@lang en
IMPORT `pti268-annex-transport`

-- Part II, the scope of cover (II. PHẠM VI BẢO HIỂM), lines 364-444 of the source:
-- A, the main benefits 1 to 4; B, the optional benefits 5 to 7. Benefit 7 is the Annex
-- (pti268-annex-transport.l4).
-- For each benefit: which events and outcomes it answers (layer 1), and how much it pays
-- (layer 2). Whether the claim as a whole is covered — eligibility, period, waiting
-- periods, exclusions — is put together in pti268-decision.l4.
--
-- LIMITS. Every sum insured and limit is the schedule's (`The limits in the schedule`).
-- Fork F27: a benefit's limit is an aggregate for the period, so the claim carries what has
-- already been paid under the benefit, and the payment is what remains, at most.

§ `Part II — Scope of cover`

§§ `Which benefits the schedule offers`

-- Benefit 5 may be taken only with accident cover and/or inpatient cover for illness;
-- Benefit 6 only with Benefit 4.
-- src:411 | (Quyền lợi này chỉ được tham gia khi tham gia bảo hiểm tai nạn và/hoặc điều trị nội trú do
-- src:412 | ốm đau bệnh tật)
-- src:430 | ( Quyền lợi này chỉ được tham gia khi đã tham gia Quyền lợi 4)
-- Fork F38: "bảo hiểm tai nạn" (accident insurance) is Benefit 1 or Benefit 2; inpatient
-- cover for illness is Benefit 4.
GIVEN claim IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the benefit claimed is in the schedule, with what it requires, in` claim IF
        elem b `the benefits`
    AND (    (NOT b EQUALS `Benefit 5`)
         OR  elem `Benefit 1` `the benefits`
         OR  elem `Benefit 2` `the benefits`
         OR  elem `Benefit 4` `the benefits`)
    AND ((NOT b EQUALS `Benefit 6`) OR elem `Benefit 4` `the benefits`)
    WHERE
        b              MEANS claim's `the benefit claimed`
        `the benefits` MEANS claim's `the contract`'s `benefits in the schedule`

§§ `What kind of event each benefit answers`

GIVEN claim IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an accident under the contract in` claim IF
    `counts as an accident under` (claim's `the contract`) (claim's `the event`)

GIVEN claim IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an illness or maternity in` claim IF
        `an illness for the 30-day wait in` claim
    OR  `maternity` (claim's `the event`'s `kind`)

GIVEN o IS AN `An outcome`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `death or permanent injury` o IF
    CONSIDER o
    WHEN `death` h                    THEN TRUE
    WHEN `total permanent injury` r l THEN TRUE
    WHEN `partial permanent injury` i THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

GIVEN o IS AN `An outcome`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `medical expenses in` o IF
    CONSIDER o
    WHEN `medical expenses` t items THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

-- Benefit 1: death or permanent injury from an accident, or (VI.11) a disappearance deemed
-- a death.
